      <uighur>tasiyalaqu</uighur>
      <cyrillic>ташаалах</cyrillic>
      <transcript>TASIJALA-</transcript>
      <definition>v. t. and i. To fence off, partition off; to separate to take cover, hide behind something, to interrupt.</definition>
      <page>783</page>
      <examples>
        <example>
          <unicode>ᠲᠠᠰᠢᠶᠠᠯᠠᠨ ᠬᠠᠷᠠᠬᠤ</unicode>
          <transcript>--n xaraxu</transcript>
          <definition> To peer from behind some object.</definition>
        </example>
        <example>
          <unicode>ᠨᠢᠭᠡᠨ ᠺᠡᠳᠦᠨ ᠡᠳᠦᠷ ᠲᠠᠰᠢᠶᠠᠯᠠᠨ</unicode>
          <transcript>nigen kedyn edyr --n</transcript>
          <definition> After a few days had elapsed, a few days later.</definition>
        </example>
      </examples>
    </entry_item>
